graph LR
    DCH["Data Connect Hub<br/>dc-controller + rest-service + flight-service"]

    %% External Dependencies
    DCH -->|metadata store| PG["PostgreSQL<br/>external, README uses 17"]
    DCH -->|columnar format / Flight| Arrow["Apache Arrow / arrow-flight 60.0.0"]
    DCH -->|gRPC| Tonic["tonic / prost 0.14"]
    DCH -->|REST server| Actix["actix-web 4.18.1"]
    DCH -->|SQL| Sqlx["sqlx 0.8 tls-rustls"]
    DCH -->|TLS| Rustls["rustls 0.23 + aws-lc-rs"]
    DCH -->|K8s client| KubeRs["kube 4.2.0 / k8s-openapi 0.28.0"]
    DCH -->|S3| OpenDAL["opendal 0.58"]
    DCH -->|Neo4j Bolt| Neo4rs["neo4rs 0.8"]
    DCH -->|operator framework| CR["controller-runtime v0.25.2"]
    DCH -->|in-process render| Kustomize["kustomize/api v0.21.1"]
    DCH -->|HTTPRoute types| GWAPI["gateway-api v1.3.0"]
    DCH -->|TLS profile, Route| OCPAPI["openshift/api"]

    %% Internal ODH Dependencies
    DCH -->|HTTPRoute parentRef| Gateway["odh-gateway<br/>Gateway API"]
    DCH -->|sidecar authN/authZ| KRP["kube-rbac-proxy<br/>odh-kube-rbac-proxy image"]
    DCH -->|Go library| PlatUtils["odh-platform-utilities<br/>TLS profile"]
    DCH -->|serving certs, CA bundle| ServiceCA["OpenShift service-CA"]
    DCH -->|ServiceMonitor| Prom["prometheus-operator /<br/>ODH monitoring"]
    DCH -.->|reads TLS profile, ingress| OCPConfig["OpenShift APIServer /<br/>Ingress / IngressController"]
    DCH -.->|future platform ConfigMap| RHODS["rhods-operator / DSC"]

    %% Integration Points
    Dashboard["ODH Dashboard"] -->|legacy ConfigMaps/Secrets migrated| DCH
    SDK["Python SDK / clients"] -->|REST + Flight| DCH

    %% External Services
    DCH -->|API server| K8sAPI["Kubernetes API"]
    DCH -->|connectors| Sources["External data sources<br/>PostgreSQL, S3, Milvus,<br/>Elasticsearch, Neo4j, URI/HF"]
    DCH -.->|optional traces| OTLP["OTLP collector"]

